flowchart TB
  user[Member opens route] --> page[Route requests data]
  page --> client[Typed API client]
  client --> api[Mock API handler]
  api --> role[Resolve role claims]
  role --> repo[Fixture repository read]
  repo --> valid[Validate payload shape]
  valid --> resp[JSON response]
  resp --> render[List, detail or retainer view]
  declare[Declare form submitted] --> localcalc[Client-side tier lookup]
  localcalc --> conf[Confirmation, no request sent]
  conf --> render